  <h1 id="how-to-use">How to use “Converetti”?</h1>
  <h2>Provide your networking details</h2>
  <p>
    Complete the profile set-up form which will enable us to match you with like-minded professionals. Our match-making
    algorithm will allocate you to a Home Group with other conference participants based on the following question(s):
  </p>
  <p><i>Which is your favourite topical interest?</i></p>
  <h2>Navigating your way through Network Hub</h2>
  <p>
    Once you complete the profile set-up form, you will enter our Network Hub - this is where you can find your
    allocated Home Group chat, join live discussions taking place on the conference stage (live chat) and manage private
    conversations with fellow participants.
  </p>
  <h2>Meeting new participants via Members</h2>
  <p>
    On the bottom right-hand side, you will find the Members page - this is where you can find other participants who
    are using our platform. You can reach out to these participants directly. Please note, the Attendees list will be
    updated as more participants join - so it's good to regularly check this page.
  </p>
  <p>
    Once you start chatting in the Network Hub or one-on-one chats, you will receive a notification about a new message
    via the email you provided in the profile set-up form.
  </p>

